# CampusPulse Attendance Frontend - Production Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to `.env.production` when building for production if your backend is hosted separately.

# If your frontend and backend are hosted on the SAME domain/subdomain (e.g. reverse proxied via Nginx):
# You can leave these EMPTY and the app will automatically use relative paths.

# If your backend API is on a DIFFERENT domain or subdomain (e.g., https://api.yourcollege.edu):
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourcollege.edu/api/v1
# VITE_WS_URL=https://api.yourcollege.edu/ws
